<title>SLOVAKIA: ING Barings withdraws from bond issue.</title>
<headline>ING Barings withdraws from bond issue.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings Slovakia on Friday said it had cancelled its mandate to manage the issuance of a 600 million crown tranche of five-year bonds for engineering company Povazske Strojarne a.s. (PS).</p>
<p>Jozef Cimra, the ING Slovakia official responsible for the planned issue, told Reuters the decision was made after a recent negative campaign in the Slovak media against PS that hurt the company's image among potential investors.</p>
</text>
